WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.940
World Masterpiece Theater

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
Homeless Child Remy

00:07.800 --> 00:14.400
"About Love"

00:15.260 --> 00:23.200
I continue wishing to see you

00:23.690 --> 00:28.360
Today we'll go on a journey

00:28.450 --> 00:32.310
That's as endless as the blue sky

00:32.820 --> 00:40.990
With joy, sorrow and hope come setbacks

00:41.360 --> 00:46.040
They repeat, they repeat

00:46.280 --> 00:50.870
What should I believe?

00:51.510 --> 00:59.880
You know nothing about love, however

01:00.320 --> 01:08.900
Someday you will feel warmth inside

01:09.730 --> 01:19.860
I dream of the day when you'll speak of love

01:20.860 --> 01:28.660
Tomorrow, our journey will begin

01:29.510 --> 01:34.000
Presented by:
Takara Fansubs

01:35.070 --> 01:40.040
Episode 9:
Fateful Encounter

02:04.460 --> 02:07.400
Home! Our home!

02:20.180 --> 02:20.970
Capi?

02:23.000 --> 02:24.020
It's cold.

02:30.630 --> 02:32.130
Joli-Coeur, are you cold?

02:32.410 --> 02:33.380
Are you okay?

02:35.980 --> 02:37.570
Good morning, everyone.

02:42.680 --> 02:44.030
Well, let's go.

02:46.780 --> 02:47.970
Depart!

03:00.820 --> 03:02.300
What is it, Zerbino?

03:07.680 --> 03:09.950
That's it. You're hungry.

03:12.310 --> 03:15.220
I am too. We'll buy bread in the next town.

03:20.990 --> 03:21.760
Five sous.

03:26.940 --> 03:27.830
Welcome.

03:29.480 --> 03:30.820
It smells so good.

03:39.660 --> 03:40.900
How much are these?

03:41.560 --> 03:44.890
The small loaf costs three sous and the big one five.

03:45.720 --> 03:46.470
Five sous.

03:53.260 --> 03:56.790
A big... No, a small loaf, please.

03:57.190 --> 03:57.850
Very well.

03:58.710 --> 03:59.350
Umm...

03:59.850 --> 04:03.000
What place in the village has the most people?

04:03.070 --> 04:06.910
Well, probably the market.

04:07.540 --> 04:08.290
Thank you.

04:10.170 --> 04:12.610
Apples! Delicious apples!

04:13.780 --> 04:17.180
These eggs are freshly laid and are very cheap.

04:17.550 --> 04:19.760
Fresh vegetables!

04:21.540 --> 04:23.830
Well, everyone, let's begin!

04:24.690 --> 04:26.960
Market shoppers, good afternoon!

04:28.680 --> 04:32.300
The Vitalis Theatre company is about to begin their performance!

04:32.670 --> 04:35.740
The troupe's first performance will star Joli-Coeur!

04:43.230 --> 04:45.460
Followed by the lovely Princess Dolce!

04:49.820 --> 04:50.920
Umm...

04:53.570 --> 04:55.570
It's no good... No one's watching.

05:03.770 --> 05:05.960
I guess I wasn't good enough.

05:07.150 --> 05:11.020
Mr. Vitalis' words would always draw in people right away.

05:15.300 --> 05:16.090
Two sous.

05:17.700 --> 05:18.650
What to do?

05:18.890 --> 05:20.370
We can't buy bread tomorrow.

05:25.680 --> 05:28.040
This isn't money, Joli-Coeur.

05:28.280 --> 05:29.630
This is my treasure.

05:30.110 --> 05:31.790
It can't buy bread.

05:45.610 --> 05:48.050
No, that's not Mr. Vitalis.

05:50.350 --> 05:53.170
No, Joli-Coeur, that's not...

05:54.540 --> 05:55.750
Mr. Vitalis is...

05:56.280 --> 05:57.530
Mr. Vitalis is...

05:59.740 --> 06:00.970
You, Vitalis.

06:02.290 --> 06:06.150
You're under arrest on charges of arson on the bakery.

06:07.140 --> 06:09.440
Take care of everyone while I'm gone!

06:10.030 --> 06:11.490
Mr. Vitalis!

06:14.570 --> 06:16.250
Mr. Vitalis!

06:16.620 --> 06:18.980
Remy, I'm entrusting the troupe to you!

06:20.320 --> 06:22.440
I'm entrusting the troupe to you!

06:24.950 --> 06:27.000
That's right, we have to cheer up!

06:27.910 --> 06:30.090
Because I made a promise to Mr. Vitalis.

06:30.400 --> 06:31.460
I have to!

06:33.060 --> 06:34.980
You miss Mr. Vitalis too?

06:38.220 --> 06:42.060
We'll go to Toulouse. We might be able to see Mr. Vitalis.

07:06.830 --> 07:08.510
We performed here.

07:30.350 --> 07:32.110
Really great!

07:39.080 --> 07:40.200
Hey, stop!

07:40.640 --> 07:41.810
Where are you going?

07:42.430 --> 07:43.820
I haven't done anything.

07:50.980 --> 07:51.890
Mimi!

07:53.140 --> 07:55.080
Father, you're in a good mood today.

07:55.130 --> 07:57.700
Yes, because the bread baked perfectly today.

07:58.670 --> 07:59.670
Remy!

08:00.440 --> 08:02.640
Mimi, I want you to leave.

08:03.260 --> 08:04.670
But, Remy is...
- Leave!

08:05.620 --> 08:07.180
Yes, father.

08:07.710 --> 08:08.860
Hurry and leave!

08:13.900 --> 08:14.900
What do you want?

08:15.120 --> 08:16.660
Please, let me see Mimi.

08:16.920 --> 08:21.970
Listen, if you take one step into my house to look for Mimi, I will call the police.

08:22.770 --> 08:25.560
Get out of this town and don't come back.

08:38.110 --> 08:41.410
Umm... We're members of Vitalis' troupe.

08:41.830 --> 08:43.750
Please let us see Mr. Vitalis.

08:44.340 --> 08:47.690
Vitalis? Oh, the arsonist.

08:48.360 --> 08:50.320
He's still not allowed visitors.

08:50.520 --> 08:51.860
They're still investigating.

08:52.500 --> 08:53.890
He's a stubborn one.

08:54.220 --> 08:57.410
Though the evidence is clear he refuses to plead guilty.

08:57.720 --> 08:59.380
But, he didn't do it.

08:59.660 --> 09:01.400
Please, let us see him.

09:01.800 --> 09:03.830
He must be really worried about us.

09:04.180 --> 09:06.120
We already told you no.

09:06.430 --> 09:09.010
We're not leaving until we see him.

09:11.650 --> 09:13.510
Get out of here, all of you!

09:13.660 --> 09:15.160
Stop!
- Shut up!

09:18.840 --> 09:19.990
He's not allowed visitors.

09:22.780 --> 09:25.470
That's the girl that was with the arsonist.

09:25.690 --> 09:29.900
Yes, you're right. I heard her troupe was lead by a criminal.

09:30.190 --> 09:33.250
It's frightening, why did they come back?

09:33.670 --> 09:36.030
We won't be able to sleep tonight.

09:36.340 --> 09:37.600
You're right.

09:40.370 --> 09:41.960
<i>Mr. Vitalis is innocent!</i>

09:55.230 --> 09:56.800
It's no use, I can't see.

10:00.230 --> 10:00.960
Joli-Coeur!

10:01.970 --> 10:04.360
No, hurry and get down, Joli-Coeur!

10:06.710 --> 10:07.790
Joli-Coeur?

10:07.970 --> 10:08.740
Hey, come here!

10:09.160 --> 10:10.480
Get that monkey!

10:11.890 --> 10:12.910
He went over there!

10:14.670 --> 10:15.730
Surround him!

10:21.460 --> 10:22.120
Hey!

10:22.630 --> 10:23.950
You're very persistent.

10:24.060 --> 10:25.300
Don't you understand?

10:25.470 --> 10:26.750
Vitalis is prohibited visitors.

10:26.950 --> 10:28.580
No, Joli-Coeur is...

10:28.670 --> 10:30.500
What's going on here?

10:30.650 --> 10:31.510
Joli-Coeur!

10:33.210 --> 10:35.040
What did they do to Joli-Coeur?

10:36.870 --> 10:38.890
You're the Vitalis Troupe?

10:39.380 --> 10:43.500
I get it now, you were trying to sneak the monkey in, weren't you?

10:43.680 --> 10:46.900
No, we just wanted to see inside.

10:48.970 --> 10:52.080
Don't argue! Next time we won't forgive you.

10:53.420 --> 10:57.830
Listen, don't underestimate the police or you'll be arrested too!

10:59.040 --> 11:00.560
Please, let me see Mr. Vitalis!

11:00.560 --> 11:02.920
Mr. Vitalis didn't do anything wrong!

11:02.940 --> 11:03.630
Let go!

11:10.020 --> 11:12.510
You there, what are you doing?

11:13.790 --> 11:15.370
Such a small child.

11:16.610 --> 11:18.860
Wake up. Please, wake up.

11:51.700 --> 11:53.260
What happened to me?

12:03.400 --> 12:04.950
What is this place?

12:52.730 --> 12:54.980
Thank goodness, you're awake.

13:19.730 --> 13:21.890
What am I doing? I'm...

13:22.360 --> 13:24.490
Thinking about things from so long ago.

13:25.510 --> 13:26.280
Umm...

13:27.510 --> 13:28.550
I'm sorry.

13:31.640 --> 13:36.150
The doctor said your injury is nothing serious but... How are you feeling?

13:36.550 --> 13:41.180
Fine, thank you, but I don't remember

13:41.440 --> 13:43.890
You collapsed in front of the police station in Toulouse.

13:44.880 --> 13:47.150
This is my home, don't you worry.

13:48.230 --> 13:48.740
Yes, ma'am.

13:50.680 --> 13:53.150
What's your name? Can you tell me?

13:53.460 --> 13:55.700
Remy, my name is Remy.

13:55.860 --> 13:58.480
Remy, what a nice name.

13:59.190 --> 14:02.300
My name is Milligan. Nice to meet you.

14:03.860 --> 14:05.010
Likewise, Mrs. Milligan.

14:07.960 --> 14:10.490
Come, your friends are waiting for you.

14:13.910 --> 14:15.100
Joli-Coeur!

14:18.520 --> 14:19.990
Sorry to worry you.

14:26.890 --> 14:29.720
No, you have to behave.
- It's all right.

14:30.600 --> 14:33.660
It's good to see you happy.

14:35.310 --> 14:36.830
What's the name of this one?

14:37.830 --> 14:39.170
This little one is Joli-Coeur.

14:40.600 --> 14:41.860
The white one is Capi.

14:42.830 --> 14:44.330
The black one is Zerbino.

14:45.590 --> 14:47.460
And this little baby is Dolce.

14:49.880 --> 14:51.870
And they're all your friends?

14:51.930 --> 14:52.420
Yes.

14:54.010 --> 14:58.460
Miss, the young lady's hot cocoa is ready.

14:58.610 --> 14:59.710
Thank you, Mary.

15:00.310 --> 15:02.400
They were like very well-behaved kids.

15:03.000 --> 15:06.150
They weren't any trouble when they were waiting for you.

15:09.630 --> 15:12.210
I've already asked the police about the situation.

15:13.420 --> 15:17.480
The leader of your troupe is still under investigation.

15:19.330 --> 15:21.510
Mr. Vitalis didn't do anything.

15:22.020 --> 15:22.950
He's innocent.

15:23.700 --> 15:26.140
But the police say that's not the case.

15:35.290 --> 15:36.720
I have to go.

15:37.430 --> 15:38.330
Right now?

15:39.170 --> 15:42.060
It's a long way from here to Toulouse.

15:42.780 --> 15:43.730
It's all right.

15:45.760 --> 15:47.700
I'm used to walking.

15:48.510 --> 15:51.750
It looks like it's about to rain.

15:52.530 --> 15:54.880
And where will you sleep tonight?

15:55.370 --> 15:56.320
I don't know...

15:57.900 --> 16:01.170
but I will find a place before dark.

16:03.610 --> 16:07.210
<i>She's such a small girl to be traveling with only animals.</i>

16:08.730 --> 16:09.370
Umm...

16:10.230 --> 16:11.660
Where's my bag?

16:12.030 --> 16:15.140
Oh, I'm sorry, I'll go get it.

16:35.090 --> 16:37.580
It seems that the monkey is unwell.

16:38.500 --> 16:39.920
It's because he doesn't like the rain.

16:40.220 --> 16:43.680
And he misses Mr. Vitalis very much.

16:44.100 --> 16:46.620
Mr. Vitalis must be a very good person.

16:47.120 --> 16:49.660
He's very kind to his animals.

16:50.270 --> 16:53.600
Such a good person couldn't be a criminal.

16:53.890 --> 16:58.540
No one would believe me.
I saw the real criminal.

16:59.820 --> 17:01.740
Someone else is the criminal.

17:04.290 --> 17:06.190
So, no matter what everyone says...

17:07.380 --> 17:10.020
I have to keep on living.

17:10.910 --> 17:13.400
Because someday the truth will be revealed.

17:15.840 --> 17:18.180
Did Mr. Vitalis say that?

17:18.490 --> 17:18.880
Yes.

17:20.910 --> 17:23.010
I... I...

17:25.740 --> 17:27.350
Well, everyone, let's go.

17:29.000 --> 17:29.710
Remy?

17:30.130 --> 17:30.520
Yes?

17:32.110 --> 17:34.450
Please, stay here tonight.

17:36.300 --> 17:39.560
Mr. Vitalis would probably feel better...

17:39.780 --> 17:42.540
knowing that you're staying here instead of on the streets.

17:44.140 --> 17:47.030
Mr. Vitalis must be a very great man.

17:47.580 --> 17:50.160
You admire him so much.

17:50.580 --> 17:53.840
It will be fine. The police will clear up the misunderstanding.

17:57.570 --> 18:01.010
I believe Mr. Vitalis is innocent.

18:12.070 --> 18:15.310
Thank you. Thank you very much.

18:16.570 --> 18:22.670
Mr. Vitalis is right. The truth will be revealed in the end...

18:23.220 --> 18:24.550
...in the end.

18:24.830 --> 18:25.360
Yes.

18:44.080 --> 18:45.310
You don't have to.

18:45.400 --> 18:47.600
No, I want to help.

18:50.820 --> 18:52.470
Where were you born?

18:52.780 --> 18:53.640
Chavanon Village.

18:56.130 --> 18:56.730
Probably...

18:57.760 --> 18:59.860
We're English.

19:00.320 --> 19:02.660
Together with his wife, the master came from England.

19:03.560 --> 19:04.400
England?

19:04.880 --> 19:10.170
Yes, because the Milligan heir, Master Arthur, has such frail health.

19:10.420 --> 19:15.710
Mary, quit talking and get to work. Quickly! Quickly!

19:19.010 --> 19:21.590
When the weather is good we live here

19:21.970 --> 19:25.250
and when it's cold we go to a warmer place in the South.

19:26.810 --> 19:28.050
Master Arthur.

19:37.570 --> 19:39.180
What a soft bed.

19:41.320 --> 19:45.750
Yes, Joli-Coeur. Mr. Vitalis would like it too.

20:19.850 --> 20:21.740
I wonder where Mrs. Milligan is?

20:26.350 --> 20:27.870
I don't need any medicine.

20:28.020 --> 20:30.540
Arthur, be a good boy.

20:31.840 --> 20:32.680
Arthur?

20:33.450 --> 20:38.030
I don't want any shots.
Nothing can cure my sickness.

20:38.360 --> 20:41.400
What are you talking about? You'll get better.

20:41.980 --> 20:43.960
The doctors said so.

20:44.930 --> 20:47.050
Arthur, please.

20:51.590 --> 20:53.370
It's useless, mother.

20:53.730 --> 20:55.200
Enough, get out!

20:55.710 --> 20:57.140
I want to be alone!

21:29.390 --> 21:31.040
Sorry to keep you waiting.

21:31.550 --> 21:32.940
You must be hungry.

21:33.910 --> 21:36.310
This is my son, Arthur.

21:36.930 --> 21:39.130
Arthur, this is Remy whom I spoke of.

21:40.960 --> 21:42.660
Good evening, Arthur.

21:42.940 --> 21:43.870
Nice to meet you.

21:56.630 --> 22:05.030
Surely, not everyone can be so strong

22:06.300 --> 22:16.930
The blue sky lifts all of the world's tears...

22:17.630 --> 22:27.310
Tomorrow's courage comes

22:27.530 --> 22:37.160
From the future that gives us our fate

22:37.400 --> 22:45.430
Try to seek for them more

22:47.040 --> 22:50.560
Give your heart to

22:50.920 --> 23:05.600
That person who is also seeking you

23:18.880 --> 23:22.790
So, you mean my son won't be able to walk again?

23:23.150 --> 23:25.470
That's enough. I can't walk anymore.

23:26.340 --> 23:28.990
Apologize to your mother!

23:33.640 --> 23:36.950
<i>Lonely Arthur</i>

23:33.640 --> 23:36.950
Next time:

23:34.050 --> 23:36.220
Arthur!
